<title>CANADA: Canadian dollar closes flat, more data awaited.</title>
<headline>Canadian dollar closes flat, more data awaited.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3690/1.3745	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3705</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3640   SUPPORT 1.3800	HI 1.3719   LO  1.3705</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3707/12    HI 1.3719     EUROPE OPEN     1.3700</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3703/08    LO 1.3700     HI 1.3713   LO  1.3701</p>
<p>-----------------------MARKET COMMENT-------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar closed slightly weaker on Tuesday at C$1.3707 (US$0.7296) from Monday's close at C$1.3702 (US$0.7299) in quiet trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>* They said the currency has been confined to a narrow range by a tug of war between bullish economic fundamentals and fear of rising U.S. rates coinciding with falling Canadian rates.</p>
